    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "13-check deterministic self-test (L1804-L1891) in ~6 s covering SHA-256 integrity, Laws 1-5, the disk closed form, the linear P/T scaling of the fixed-T solver, FD-vs-modal agreement for Robin, clamped and free inner faces, the beta-sweep ordering, the 17-measurement contract and bitwise determinism; default render ~7 s; seed, grid and tolerances fixed in code; CLI documented in argparse. Deductions: the specimen lobeyness recorded by v2 (1.506) is not reproduced in this environment (1.316) by unchanged segmentation code — environment-induced result drift the rubric counts against this dimension (-6); there is no pinned requirements lock for this slot (-3); the invocation does not mention MPLCONFIGDIR / font-cache side effects (-1); README-level documentation of the Pass 3 CLI flags exists only in argparse help (-2)." ;
