    rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) & Fu et al. (2005) ROP2-ROP6 interdigitated puzzle-shaped pavement cell lobing, Largest Empty Circle (LEC) turgor stress scaling, reduced pressurized periclinal membrane-shell and depth-resolved anticlinal wall buckling — Source and data traceability: 92/100" ;
