<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/runions-pavement-cell-lobing-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) Largest Empty Circle (LEC) Turgor Stress Suppression Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that puzzle-shaped interdigitation pins the Largest Empty Circle radius R_LEC near the neck half-width R_0 (~11 um) as cell area A grows 10-20x, suppressing outer periclinal wall tensile stress by >3x compared to unlobed isotropic cells | Variables: P: turgor pressure (MPa); h: outer periclinal cell wall thickness (um); R_LEC: radius of Largest Empty/Inscribed Circle inside cell contour (um); R_0: bounded neck half-width (um); N = A/(π R_0^2): effective lobe-unit area multiple" ;
    dct:source "Sapala et al. (2018) eLife 7:e32794 Figs. 1-3 & Box 1" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py#L215-L527>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_039_pavement_cell_lobing.lean#L31-L50> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def puzzle_lec_radius_sq (r0_sq : Int) : Int := r0_sq
def isotropic_radius_sq (N r0_sq : Int) : Int := N * r0_sq
theorem sapala_2018_lec_stress_suppression (N r0_sq : Int)
    (hN : N ≥ 2) (hr0 : r0_sq > 0) :
    isotropic_radius_sq N r0_sq - puzzle_lec_radius_sq r0_sq = (N - 1) * r0_sq ∧
    2 * puzzle_lec_radius_sq r0_sq ≤ isotropic_radius_sq N r0_sq ∧
    puzzle_lec_radius_sq r0_sq < isotropic_radius_sq N r0_sq
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "σ_max = P R_LEC / (2h);  R_LEC^2(WT) = R_0^2 ≪ R_iso^2(A) = A / π = N R_0^2  (for N ≥ 2 lobes)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2004.12.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2013.01.022>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41477-019-0500-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1105/tpc.114.126664>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.32794> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled ROP2–ROP6 Cross-Inhibitory Cortical Reaction–Diffusion, Turgor-Driven Largest Empty Circle (LEC) Stress Scaling, Reduced Föppl Pressurized Periclinal Membrane-Shell & Depth-Resolved Anticlinal Wall Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.puzzle_lec_radius_sq" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.sapala_2018_lec_stress_suppression" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/runions-pavement-cell-lobing-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Fu et al. (2005) ROP2–ROP6 Trans-Wall Complementarity & Intercellular Area Conservation Law" ;
    dct:description "Establishes alternating ROP2 (convex lobe outgrowth) and ROP6 (concave neck microtubule bundling) domains in antiphase across shared anticlinal walls while preserving contiguous epidermal tiling without intercellular gaps | Variables: U(s,t): active cortical ROP2-RIC4 concentration; V(s,t): active cortical ROP6-RIC1-KTN1 concentration; V_opp: opposing cell cortical ROP6 across shared anticlinal wall; δ_lobe: local anticlinal wall displacement" ;
    dct:source "Fu et al. (2005) Cell 120(5):687-700 Figs. 1-7; Bidhendi et al. (2019) Nature Plants 5:981-992" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py#L533-L662>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_039_pavement_cell_lobing.lean#L68-L83> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cell_A_lobe_area (A0 d_lobe : Int) : Int := A0 + d_lobe
def cell_B_neck_area (B0 d_lobe : Int) : Int := B0 - d_lobe
def cortical_rop_polarity (rop2 rop6 : Int) : Int := rop2 - rop6
theorem fu_2005_rop2_rop6_trans_wall_conservation (A0 B0 d_lobe r_hi r_lo : Int) :
    cell_A_lobe_area A0 d_lobe + cell_B_neck_area B0 d_lobe = A0 + B0 ∧
    cortical_rop_polarity r_hi r_lo + cortical_rop_polarity r_lo r_hi = 0
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "∂U/∂t = D_u ∂²U/∂s² + (k_0 + k_a U²/(1+U²))/(1 + γ_{26} V²) (1 + α V_opp) - k_off U;  A_A(δ) + A_B(-δ) = A_0 + B_0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2004.12.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2013.01.022>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41477-019-0500-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1105/tpc.114.126664>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.32794> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled ROP2–ROP6 Cross-Inhibitory Cortical Reaction–Diffusion, Turgor-Driven Largest Empty Circle (LEC) Stress Scaling, Reduced Föppl Pressurized Periclinal Membrane-Shell & Depth-Resolved Anticlinal Wall Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.cell_A_lobe_area" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.fu_2005_rop2_rop6_trans_wall_conservation" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/runions-pavement-cell-lobing-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) & Lin et al. (2013) ktn1 / rop2 rop4 Mutant Lobeyness & Solidity Collapse Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that loss of ROP2/ROP4 or katanin KTN1/RIC1 microtubule severing collapses lobeyness to L -> 1 and solidity to S -> 1, causing unchecked R_LEC ~ sqrt(A/pi) growth and high periclinal wall tensile stress | Variables: L = P_perim / P_hull: pavement cell lobeyness; S = A_cell / A_hull: convex solidity; k_rop: ROP2-ROP6-KTN1 mechanochemical coupling strength; A_lobe: sinusoidal lobe amplitude" ;
    dct:source "Sapala et al. (2018) eLife 7:e32794 Fig. 5; Lin et al. (2013) Current Biology 23:290-297" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py#L268-L407>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_039_pavement_cell_lobing.lean#L99-L115> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def lobed_perimeter (P_hull k_rop A_lobe : Int) : Int := P_hull + k_rop * A_lobe
def lobed_hull_area (A_cell k_rop A_indent : Int) : Int := A_cell + k_rop * A_indent
theorem sapala_2018_mutant_lobeyness_collapse (P_hull A_cell k_rop A_lobe A_indent : Int)
    (hk : k_rop > 0) (hA : A_lobe > 0) :
    lobed_perimeter P_hull 0 A_lobe = P_hull ∧
    lobed_perimeter P_hull k_rop 0 = P_hull ∧
    lobed_hull_area A_cell 0 A_indent = A_cell ∧
    lobed_perimeter P_hull k_rop A_lobe > P_hull
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "L = P_perim / P_hull = (P_hull + k_rop A_lobe) / P_hull,  S = A_cell / (A_cell + k_rop A_indent)  ⇒  L(k_rop=0) = 1, S(k_rop=0) = 1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2004.12.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2013.01.022>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41477-019-0500-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1105/tpc.114.126664>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.32794> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled ROP2–ROP6 Cross-Inhibitory Cortical Reaction–Diffusion, Turgor-Driven Largest Empty Circle (LEC) Stress Scaling, Reduced Föppl Pressurized Periclinal Membrane-Shell & Depth-Resolved Anticlinal Wall Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.lobed_perimeter" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.sapala_2018_mutant_lobeyness_collapse" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/runions-pavement-cell-lobing-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Pressurized Periclinal Föppl Membrane & Inscribed-Disk Deflection Bound" ;
    dct:description "Reduced (NOT finite-element) 3D periclinal shell: solved by sparse finite differences on the rasterised cell footprint with self-consistent tension and verified against the closed-form disk (z_max rel. err. < 1 %); used to TEST the Sapala et al. (2018) LEC stress proxy — shell stress tracks R_LEC (r = 0.98) but sub-linearly (fitted exponent ≈ 0.51 vs Laplace 1), giving an isotropic/WT stress ratio of ≈ 1.7 instead of the proxy's 3.32 | Variables: z(x,y): out-of-plane bulge of the outer periclinal wall (um); T: uniform membrane tension (uN/um); T_0 = PH/2: pretension transmitted by the pressurised anticlinal walls of depth H; E, ν: wall Young's modulus and Poisson ratio; ε̄: mean membrane stretch; σ_m: membrane stress; σ_b: clamped-edge bending boundary-layer stress; ℓ_b: bending boundary-layer width; D = E h³/(12(1-ν²))" ;
    dct:source "Sapala et al. (2018) eLife 7:e32794 Fig. 3 & Box 1 (LEC stress proxy); Timoshenko & Woinowsky-Krieger (1959) Theory of Plates and Shells (uniformly loaded circular membrane)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py#L668-L933>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_039_pavement_cell_lobing.lean#L134-L156> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def disk_membrane_deflection_4T (P R_sq r_sq : Int) : Int := P * (R_sq - r_sq)
theorem sapala_2018_pressurized_membrane_inscribed_disk_bound (P R_sq r_sq N r0_sq : Int)
    (hP : 0 < P) (hr : 0 ≤ r_sq) (hrR : r_sq ≤ R_sq) (hN : N ≥ 2) (hr0 : 0 < r0_sq) :
    disk_membrane_deflection_4T P R_sq r_sq ≤ disk_membrane_deflection_4T P R_sq 0 ∧
    0 ≤ disk_membrane_deflection_4T P R_sq r_sq ∧
    disk_membrane_deflection_4T P (puzzle_lec_radius_sq r0_sq) 0 <
      disk_membrane_deflection_4T P (isotropic_radius_sq N r0_sq) 0
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "-T ∇²z = P on Ω, z = 0 on ∂Ω;  T = T_0 + E h ε̄/(1-ν), ε̄ = ⟨½|∇z|²⟩, T_0 = P H/2;  disk: z(r) = P (R² - r²)/(4T);  z_max(Ω) ≥ P R_LEC²/(4T);  σ_m = T/h, σ_b = 6 T θ̄_edge ℓ_b / h², ℓ_b = sqrt(D/T)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2004.12.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2013.01.022>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41477-019-0500-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1105/tpc.114.126664>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.32794> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled ROP2–ROP6 Cross-Inhibitory Cortical Reaction–Diffusion, Turgor-Driven Largest Empty Circle (LEC) Stress Scaling, Reduced Föppl Pressurized Periclinal Membrane-Shell & Depth-Resolved Anticlinal Wall Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.disk_membrane_deflection_4T" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.sapala_2018_pressurized_membrane_inscribed_disk_bound" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/runions-pavement-cell-lobing-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Depth-Resolved Anticlinal Wall Buckling: Outward Monotonicity & Wavenumber Ordering" ;
    dct:description "Resolves the Pass 2 anticlinal buckling with depth: under outer-junction forcing the k = 8 (24.5 um) lobe mode decays to 2.8 % of its outer amplitude at the inner face (β = 2, H = 15 um; e^-1 penetration 4 um), harmonics decay faster, and only depth-distributed forcing (ROP6-RIC1 microtubule bundles spanning the wall) keeps lobes through the full depth (inner/outer 0.70) — a model prediction verified against its analytic solution, not against a specimen | Variables: δ(s,ζ): lateral anticlinal wall deflection; s: arc length along the shared wall (L = 196 um); ζ: depth from inner (0) to outer (H) periclinal junction; δ_top(s): ROP2-ROP6 polarity-driven outer-face displacement; β = k_in H/T_a: dimensionless Robin stiffness of the inner face (0 = free, ∞ = clamped); κ = k²Δζ²: discrete squared wavenumber" ;
    dct:source "Fu et al. (2005) Cell 120:687-700; Bidhendi et al. (2019) Nature Plants 5:981-992; Armour et al. (2015) Plant Cell 27:2484-2500 (depth context)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py#L939-L1158>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_039_pavement_cell_lobing.lean#L164-L217> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def depth_mode (κ a : Int) : Nat → Int
  | 0 => 0
  | 1 => a
  | n + 2 => (2 + κ) * depth_mode κ a (n + 1) - depth_mode κ a n
theorem anticlinal_depth_mode_monotone_outward (κ a : Int) (hκ : 0 ≤ κ) (ha : 0 < a) :
    ∀ n : Nat, depth_mode κ a n < depth_mode κ a (n + 1) ∧ 0 < depth_mode κ a (n + 1)
theorem anticlinal_depth_mode_wavenumber_comparison (κ κ' a : Int)
    (hκ : 0 ≤ κ) (hκκ' : κ ≤ κ') (ha : 0 < a) :
    ∀ n : Nat, depth_mode κ a n ≤ depth_mode κ' a n ∧
      depth_mode κ a (n + 1) - depth_mode κ a n ≤ depth_mode κ' a (n + 1) - depth_mode κ' a n
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "∂²δ/∂s² + ∂²δ/∂ζ² = 0 on [0,L]×[0,H], δ(s,H) = δ_top(s), T_a ∂δ/∂ζ(s,0) = k_in δ(s,0);  δ̂_k(ζ) = δ̂_k(H) [k cosh(kζ) + β' sinh(kζ)]/[k cosh(kH) + β' sinh(kH)], β' = β/H;  discrete clamped mode δ_{j+2} = (2 + k²Δζ²) δ_{j+1} - δ_j, δ_0 = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2004.12.026>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2013.01.022>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41477-019-0500-2>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1105/tpc.114.126664>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.32794> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Coupled ROP2–ROP6 Cross-Inhibitory Cortical Reaction–Diffusion, Turgor-Driven Largest Empty Circle (LEC) Stress Scaling, Reduced Föppl Pressurized Periclinal Membrane-Shell & Depth-Resolved Anticlinal Wall Buckling" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.depth_mode" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_039.anticlinal_depth_mode_monotone_outward" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> a skos:Concept,
